title Step through assist levels 1-5 while pedalling at 70 rpm

at 0 level 1
at 1000 cadence 70 over 500
at 3000 level 2
at 5000 level 3
at 7000 level 4
at 9000 level 5
at 11000 cadence 0

end 12000

# Default level currents (7/10/14/19/26%), trimmed by "keep current" at 70 rpm.
expect 2900 current == 7
expect 4900 current == 10
expect 6900 current == 13
expect 8900 current == 18
expect 10900 current == 24
